[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Segarish Fisher Dashboard Kiosk
Comment=Launches the fisher dashboard in Chromium kiosk mode on boot
Exec=/home/pi/segarish-fisher-dashboard/deploy/kiosk.sh
X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=true
NoDisplay=false
Terminal=false

; Install: copy (or symlink) to ~/.config/autostart/segarish-kiosk.desktop
; on the account that auto-logs into the desktop session. Works under the
; XDG autostart spec, which covers LXDE/X11 Pi OS setups and most
; Wayland compositors' autostart support. If your Pi OS image's default
; compositor (labwc, on current Raspberry Pi OS Bookworm) doesn't pick
; this up, add instead to ~/.config/labwc/autostart:
;   /home/pi/segarish-fisher-dashboard/deploy/kiosk.sh &
; See README.md "Raspberry Pi bring-up" for the full walkthrough.
